## 9. Testing Before Production
- ❌ NEVER push directly to production without local testing
- ✅ ALWAYS test locally first (localhost:8001 backend, localhost:3000 frontend)
- ✅ ALWAYS test all CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)
- ✅ ALWAYS test file uploads
- ✅ ALWAYS test with API tokens (not just JWT)
- ✅ ALWAYS verify storage URLs in API responses
- ✅ ALWAYS check database schema matches code expectations
- ✅ ALWAYS run migrations locally before deploying
- ✅ ALWAYS check for console errors in browser
- ✅ ALWAYS verify API responses with Postman/curl

## 10. Production Deployment Wait Time
- ⚠️ CRITICAL: Production deployments take at least 2 minutes and 30 seconds to complete
- ❌ NEVER test endpoints immediately after pushing changes to production
- ✅ ALWAYS wait for deployment to finish before testing
- ✅ ALWAYS wait 2.5 minutes after git push before testing production endpoints
- ✅ ALWAYS check deployment status before testing

## 11. Encryption Key Management
- ❌ NEVER share encryption keys between environments (local, staging, production)
- ❌ NEVER migrate encrypted data between environments
- ❌ NEVER run `php artisan key:generate` on production without backup
- ✅ ALWAYS generate unique APP_KEY for each environment
- ✅ ALWAYS test encryption/decryption after deployment
- ✅ ALWAYS use environment-specific configuration files
- ✅ ALWAYS have fallback mechanisms for encrypted data
- ✅ ALWAYS monitor encryption health with `/api/cv-ai/check-encryption`
- ⚠️ CRITICAL: API keys encrypted with wrong key cause "The MAC is invalid" error
- ✅ **GITHUB SECRET SOLUTION**: Store stable APP_KEY as `STABLE_APP_KEY` GitHub Secret
- ✅ **DEPLOYMENT WORKFLOW**: Uses `STABLE_APP_KEY` secret to prevent key changes
- ✅ **FALLBACK**: If secret missing, generates new key and logs warning
- ✅ **BACKUP SYSTEM**: Current key backed up to database before migrations
- ⚠️ **CRITICAL**: Never change `STABLE_APP_KEY` secret without updating all encrypted data

