## Mistake 11: SSH connection issues
**Cause:** Wrong credentials, network issues, or server problems
**Solution:**
```bash
# Test SSH connection
ssh -p 21098 -v ${{ secrets.USERNAME }}@${{ secrets.HOST }}

# Check if server is reachable
ping ${{ secrets.HOST }}

# Verify SSH key permissions (local)
chmod 600 ~/.ssh/id_rsa
chmod 644 ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub

# Test with specific key
ssh -p 21098 -i ~/.ssh/id_rsa ${{ secrets.USERNAME }}@${{ secrets.HOST }}
```

## Mistake 12: Database connection fails via SSH
**Cause:** PostgreSQL not running, wrong credentials, or network issues
**Solution:**
```bash
# Check if PostgreSQL is running
sudo systemctl status postgresql

# Test database connection
PGPASSWORD='mg08.Rcrld}N' psql -h localhost -U timesovh_naqash_thaheem -d timesovh_naqashthaheem -c "SELECT version();"

# Check database user permissions
PGPASSWORD='mg08.Rcrld}N' psql -h localhost -U timesovh_naqash_thaheem -d timesovh_naqashthaheem -c "\du"
```

## Mistake 13: File permission issues on production
**Cause:** Wrong ownership or permissions on storage/cache directories
**Solution:**
```bash
# Fix ownership (run as appropriate user)
sudo chown -R ${{ secrets.USERNAME }}:${{ secrets.USERNAME }} ~/naqashthaheem.com/

# Fix permissions
chmod -R 775 ~/naqashthaheem.com/backend/storage/
chmod -R 775 ~/naqashthaheem.com/backend/bootstrap/cache/

# Check symlinks
ls -la ~/naqashthaheem.com/public_html/storage
ls -la ~/naqashthaheem.com/public_html/api/public/storage
```

## Mistake 14: Encryption key changes on every deployment
**Cause:** Deployment workflow generates new APP_KEY each time, breaking encrypted data
**Solution:**
```bash
# 1. Add STABLE_APP_KEY as GitHub Secret
# Go to: GitHub Repository → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
# Name: STABLE_APP_KEY
# Value: base64:... (current production APP_KEY)

# 2. Verify secret is working
curl https://naqashthaheem.com/api/cv-ai/check-encryption

# 3. If still changing, check deployment workflow logs
# Look for "STABLE_APP_KEY secret not found" warnings

# 4. Emergency fix if secret missing
ssh -p 21098 timesovh@162.254.39.126
cd ~/naqashthaheem.com/backend
php fix_production_encryption_script.php
```

